      ],
      "source": "https://roadsidethoughts.com/md/pleasant-grove-xx-allegany-profile.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pleasant Grove lies east of Cumberland along Maryland Route 144, the old alignment of U.S. Highway 40.",
